       <property name="toolTip">
        <string>Expected size of one character in the image, in pixels (its longest side).
Character size in pixels = character size on the ground / ground sample distance (GSD).
Example: a 2 m (6.5 ft) letter photographed at 2 cm/pixel is about 100 pixels tall.</string>
